From a69f49d8d64e739b0007646f9af3957100d10399 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sumanjeet0012 <sumanjeet0012@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 13:34:42 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] feat(bitswap): Implement session-based architecture
 (Phase 3)

- Introduce BitswapSession for scoped peer discovery and fetch logic
- Implement SessionInterestManager (SIM) to correctly route arriving blocks to awaiting sessions
- Integrate ProviderQueryManager fallback within BitswapSession
- Refactor test suite to mock the new session-based structure
